      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-001-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 55,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-001-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 2.928
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N4-001",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "明日は雨が降ると思います。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-001-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 55,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-001-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 2.736
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N4-002",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "これは「さくら」という店です。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-002-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 55,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-002-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 2.928
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N4-002",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "試験が延期になったという連絡が来ました。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-002-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 55,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-002-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.432
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N4-003",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "先生は「明日は休みです」と言いました。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-003-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 56,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-003-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.744
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N4-003",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "友達は少し遅れると言っていました。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-003-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 56,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N4-003-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.096
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-001",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "日本の文化について調べています。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-001-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 121,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-001-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.528
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-001",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "試験についての質問があります。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-001-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 121,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-001-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.216
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-002",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "費用に関しては、後で説明します。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-002-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 121,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-002-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.888
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-002",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "環境に関する本を読みました。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-002-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 121,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-002-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.264
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-003",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "先生に対して失礼なことを言ってはいけません。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-003-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 122,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-003-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.44
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-003",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "この意見に対して、質問があります。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-003-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 122,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-003-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.768
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-004",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "兄は静かなのに対して、弟はよく話します。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-004-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 122,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-004-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.776
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-004",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "去年は暑かったのに対して、今年は涼しいです。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-004-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 122,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-004-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.656
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-005",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "私にとって、家族が一番大切です。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-005-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 123,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-005-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.224
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-005",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "この問題は初心者にとって難しいです。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-005-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 123,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-005-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.128
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-006",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "学生として、授業に参加します。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-006-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 123,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-006-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.816
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-006",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "この部屋を会議室として使います。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-006-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 123,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-006-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.432
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-007",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "天気予報によると、明日は雨だそうです。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-007-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 124,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-007-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.128
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-007",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "新聞によれば、新しい橋ができるそうです。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-007-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 124,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-007-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.392
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-008",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "好みは人によって違います。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-008-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 124,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-008-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 2.976
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-008",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "季節によって、店の営業時間が変わります。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-008-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 124,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-008-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.344
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-009",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "大雨によって、電車が止まりました。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-009-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 125,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-009-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.648
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-009",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "地震による被害を調べています。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-009-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 125,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-009-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.336
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-010",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "話し合いによって問題を解決しました。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-010-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 125,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-010-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.72
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-010",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "練習によって、発音がよくなりました。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-010-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 125,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N3-010-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.984
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-001",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "雨にもかかわらず、多くの人が集まりました。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-001-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 214,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-001-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.248
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-001",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "十分寝たにもかかわらず、まだ眠いです。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-001-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 214,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-001-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.056
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-002",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "本を買ったものの、まだ読んでいません。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-002-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 214,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-002-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-002",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "方法は分かったものの、実行は難しいです。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-002-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 214,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-002-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.344
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-003",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "高いからといって、必ずしも品質がよいとは限りません。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-003-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 215,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-003-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 5.16
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-003",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "忙しいからといって、約束を忘れてはいけません。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-003-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 215,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-003-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.608
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-004",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "年齢にかかわらず、誰でも参加できます。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-004-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 215,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-004-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.128
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-004",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "雨が降るかどうかにかかわらず、実施します。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-004-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 215,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-004-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.248
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-005",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "経験の有無を問わず、募集しています。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-005-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 216,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-005-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.888
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-005",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "この仕事は昼夜を問わず続きます。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-005-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 216,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-005-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.792
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-006",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "この問題は日本に限らず、各国で起きています。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-006-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 216,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-006-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.776
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-006",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "子供に限らず、大人にも人気があります。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-006-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 216,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-006-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.104
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-007",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "急いでいる日に限って、電車が遅れます。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-007-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 217,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-007-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.104
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-007",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "彼に限って、うそをつくはずがありません。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-007-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 217,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-007-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.912
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-008",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "暑い日は、冷たい水に限ります。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-008-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 217,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-008-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.768
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-008",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "疲れたときは、早く寝るに限ります。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-008-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 217,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-008-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.864
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-009",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "元気である限り、働きたいです。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-009-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 218,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-009-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.624
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-009",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "ここに住んでいる限り、この規則を守ってください。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-009-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 218,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-009-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.632
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-010",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "本人が来ない限り、手続きはできません。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-010-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 218,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-010-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.128
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-010",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "雨が降らない限り、毎朝走ります。",
      "voice": "nanami",
      "src": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-010-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 218,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/nanami/N2-010-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.032
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-001",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "日本の文化について調べています。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-001-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 121,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-001-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.048
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-001",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "試験についての質問があります。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-001-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 121,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-001-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 2.928
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-002",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "費用に関しては、後で説明します。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-002-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 121,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-002-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.648
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-002",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "環境に関する本を読みました。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-002-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 121,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-002-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-003",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "先生に対して失礼なことを言ってはいけません。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-003-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 122,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-003-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.792
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-003",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "この意見に対して、質問があります。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-003-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 122,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-003-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-004",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "兄は静かなのに対して、弟はよく話します。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-004-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 122,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-004-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.392
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-004",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "去年は暑かったのに対して、今年は涼しいです。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-004-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 122,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-004-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.344
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-005",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "私にとって、家族が一番大切です。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-005-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 123,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-005-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.008
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-005",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "この問題は初心者にとって難しいです。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-005-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 123,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-005-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.72
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-006",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "学生として、授業に参加します。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-006-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 123,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-006-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.552
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-006",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "この部屋を会議室として使います。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-006-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 123,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-006-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.024
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-007",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "天気予報によると、明日は雨だそうです。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-007-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 124,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-007-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.936
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-007",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "新聞によれば、新しい橋ができるそうです。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-007-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 124,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-007-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.152
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-008",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "好みは人によって違います。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-008-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 124,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-008-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 2.712
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-008",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "季節によって、店の営業時間が変わります。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-008-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 124,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-008-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.176
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-009",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "大雨によって、電車が止まりました。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-009-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 125,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-009-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.48
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-009",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "地震による被害を調べています。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-009-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 125,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-009-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 2.976
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-010",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "話し合いによって問題を解決しました。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-010-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 125,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-010-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.456
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N3-010",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "練習によって、発音がよくなりました。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-010-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 125,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N3-010-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.696
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-001",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "雨にもかかわらず、多くの人が集まりました。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-001-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 214,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-001-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.056
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-001",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "十分寝たにもかかわらず、まだ眠いです。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-001-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 214,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-001-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.936
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-002",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "本を買ったものの、まだ読んでいません。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-002-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 214,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-002-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.408
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-002",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "方法は分かったものの、実行は難しいです。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-002-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 214,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-002-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.296
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-003",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "高いからといって、必ずしも品質がよいとは限りません。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-003-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 215,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-003-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.728
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-003",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "忙しいからといって、約束を忘れてはいけません。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-003-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 215,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-003-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.416
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-004",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "年齢にかかわらず、誰でも参加できます。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-004-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 215,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-004-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.984
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-004",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "雨が降るかどうかにかかわらず、実施します。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-004-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 215,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-004-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.008
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-005",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "経験の有無を問わず、募集しています。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-005-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 216,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-005-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.624
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-005",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "この仕事は昼夜を問わず続きます。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-005-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 216,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-005-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.384
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-006",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "この問題は日本に限らず、各国で起きています。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-006-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 216,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-006-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.368
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-006",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "子供に限らず、大人にも人気があります。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-006-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 216,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-006-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.864
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-007",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "急いでいる日に限って、電車が遅れます。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-007-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 217,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-007-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.912
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-007",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "彼に限って、うそをつくはずがありません。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-007-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 217,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-007-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.768
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-008",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "暑い日は、冷たい水に限ります。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-008-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 217,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-008-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.552
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-008",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "疲れたときは、早く寝るに限ります。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-008-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 217,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-008-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.504
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-009",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "元気である限り、働きたいです。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-009-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 218,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-009-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.312
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-009",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "ここに住んでいる限り、この規則を守ってください。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-009-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 218,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-009-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 4.128
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-010",
      "exampleIndex": 0,
      "text": "本人が来ない限り、手続きはできません。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-010-1.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 218,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-010-1.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.816
    },
    {
      "entryId": "N2-010",
      "exampleIndex": 1,
      "text": "雨が降らない限り、毎朝走ります。",
      "voice": "keita",
      "src": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-010-2.mp3",
      "pdfPage": 218,
      "srt": "/audio/voices/keita/N2-010-2.srt",
      "durationSeconds": 3.696
    }
